            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.1+1CH.11.2+1CH.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 11.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then all the tribes of Israel came to David at Hebron, and said, “Behold, we are your bone and flesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In times past, when Saul was king over us, it was you that led out and brought in Israel; and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to you, ‘You shall be shepherd of my people Israel, and you shall be prince over Israel.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So all the elders of Israel came to the king at Hebron; and King David made a covenant with them at Hebron before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and they anointed David king over Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 3.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " David was thirty years old when he began to reign, and he reigned forty years. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At Hebron he reigned over Judah seven years and six months; and at Jerusalem he reigned over all Israel and Judah thirty-three years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
